        {
          "id": "d04-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q3 2025, management expects continued margin expansion as the pricing changes flow through renewals. Capital expenditure for Q3 2025 is budgeted at $7.3M, the majority allocated to office consolidation.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
